title: "synthetic-ppi-reference: reference BioCypher adapter for the agentic workspace evaluation"
abstract: >-
  Reference solution of a BioCypher adapter project for the Synthetic Protein
  Interaction Dataset, used as ground truth to evaluate language models in the
  BioCypher agentic workspace.
